@AngularSquadBackend_HostAddress = https://localhost:7001
@token = replace-with-a-valid-jwt

### Get a doctor's details for today
GET {{AngularSquadBackend_HostAddress}}/api/dokter/1/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Doctor not found
GET {{AngularSquadBackend_HostAddress}}/api/dokter/999999/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
